WEBVTT

00:09:00.163 --> 00:09:03.497
a real strategic innovation playground.

00:09:04.030 --> 00:09:07.763
And I believe that's possible
if the will is there.

00:09:08.663 --> 00:09:13.330
So I hope this little presentation
helped you see that innovation,

00:09:13.330 --> 00:09:18.230
entrepreneurship and disruption is
not about the creative genius.

00:09:18.397 --> 00:09:22.863
It's increasingly a profession, a
discipline that you can learn.

00:09:23.530 --> 00:09:25.563
But of course, like in tennis,

00:09:26.030 --> 00:09:29.463
not all of us will be a Roger
Federer or Rafa Nadal.

00:09:29.763 --> 00:09:34.663
It takes a lot of practice until you
get up there and like in tennis